---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: "/work/"
title: "Areas of Work"
description: "The four areas Max Murphy works across: product strategy, AI-native products, enterprise platforms, and 0→1 product."
---
<section class="page-head wrap">
  <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--blue)">Areas of Work</p>
  <h1 class="display">Four questions I keep working on.</h1>
  <p class="prose measure">Twelve years of product work across fintech, enterprise SaaS, marketplaces, and early-stage ventures keeps coming back to the same four problems. These are the ones I&rsquo;ve spent the most time on and have the most to say about.</p>
</section>

<section class="section section--tight wrap">
  <div class="posts">
    {%- for area in areas %}
    <article class="post">
      <div class="post__date">{{ "0" + (loop.index | string) }}</div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="post__title"><a href="/work/{{ area.slug }}/">{{ area.title }}</a></h2>
        <p class="prose" style="font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:.75rem">{{ area.question }}</p>
        <p class="post__excerpt">{{ area.summary }}</p>
        <a class="arrow-link" href="/work/{{ area.slug }}/">Explore {{ area.title }}</a>
      </div>
    </article>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band cta">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="headline">Have an ambitious idea?</h2>
    <p class="prose measure" style="margin-inline:auto">I take on a small number of strategic engagements each year. Tell me about your problem &mdash; I&rsquo;ll tell you what I&rsquo;d do about it.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:2rem">
      <a class="btn btn--solid" href="/contact/" style="background:#fff;color:var(--blue)">Get in touch</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
